<!-- Listen-friendly content -->
<div class="listen-friendly-content" style="display: none;" aria-hidden="true">
  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: DreamReasoner-8B — Block-Size Curriculum for Diffusion Reasoning</h2>
    <p>Autoregressive language models generate tokens one at a time — strictly serial. Diffusion language models can generate many tokens in parallel by iteratively denoising a masked sequence, but full-sequence diffusion struggles with long chain-of-thought reasoning. Block diffusion is a compromise: it generates blocks of B tokens in parallel via diffusion while keeping blocks sequential like autoregressive generation.</p>
    <p>The paper's key finding is that training with large block sizes — say B=32 — causes reasoning ability to collapse entirely. A model trained with B=32 achieves only 20% on AIME 2024 under fine-grained inference, versus 47% for the same model trained with B=4. The fix is block-size curriculum learning: train first with small blocks to build tight local reasoning patterns, then expose the model to larger blocks. The curriculum-trained DreamReasoner-8B matches Qwen3-8B-Thinking on math and code while delivering up to 3× tokens per forward pass at B=32. The paper also introduces RelaxedConfidence decoding, which lowers the per-token commitment threshold for tokens surrounded by confident neighbors, yielding up to 59% additional throughput during structured answering phases.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：DreamReasoner-8B——扩散推理模型的块大小课程学习</h2>
    <p>自回归语言模型每次只生成一个词元，严格串行执行。扩散语言模型通过对掩码序列的迭代去噪，可以并行生成多个词元，但全序列扩散在长链式思维推理上表现欠佳。块扩散是一种折衷方案：在块内并行去噪B个词元，块间保持自回归顺序。</p>
    <p>论文的核心发现是：使用较大块（如B=32）训练会导致推理能力完全崩溃。使用B=32训练的模型在细粒度推理下AIME 2024仅得20%，而B=4训练则达47%。解决方案是块大小课程学习：先以小块训练建立紧密的局部推理模式，再逐渐引入更大块。课程训练的DreamReasoner-8B在数学和代码任务上与Qwen3-8B-Thinking相当，同时B=32下每次前向传播的词元数达到3倍。论文还提出RelaxedConfidence解码，为被高置信度邻居包围的词元降低承诺阈值，在结构化回答阶段额外提升最高59%的吞吐量。</p>
  </div>
</div>

